{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22855","headline":"题元八谿居 · 白居易","name":"题元八谿居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"溪岚漠漠树重重，水槛山窗次第逢。\n晚叶尚开红踯躅，秋芳初结白芙蓉。\n声来枕上千年鹤，影落杯中五老峰。\n更媿殷勤留客意，鱼鲜饭细酒香浓。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22855.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22855","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}